      "comment" : "App menu item that opens the About window (standard macOS menu item; Lidless is the app name)"
    },
    "Above 100%, Boost makes the screen brighter than normal." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the built-in brightness slider when Boost can be used"
    },
    "Add Control or Command to the keys." : {
      "comment" : "Shortcut recorder: the keys pressed had neither Control nor Command"
    },
    "Also checked at wake and login." : {
      "comment" : "Safety net item 1 helper"
    },
